    {
      "datasource": {"type": "datasource", "uid": "grafana"},
      "description": "The baseline drives measured BFD and convergence runs. The candidate adds service dual-homing for deterministic N-1 and shared-risk audits.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 12, "w": 14, "x": 0, "y": 4},
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "code": {"language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false},
        "content": "### OSPF Area 0 · baseline measurement topology\n\n`service-host 10.20.0.0/24 ── cost 10 ── core1`\n\n| Layer | Primary cost 10 | Backup cost 100 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Core ↔ aggregation | `core1–agg1`, `core2–agg2` | `core1–agg2`, `core2–agg1` |\n| Aggregation ↔ access | `agg1–access1`, `agg2–access2` | `agg1–access2`, `agg2–access1` |\n\nThe cores also have a `core1–core2` transit link at cost `20`. The normal access1 service path is **metric 30**; the tested cross-fabric failover path is **metric 140**.\n\n### Candidate used by N-1 and shared-risk audits\n\nThe transport fabric stays the same. `intent-dual-homed.yml` changes the service prefix to `10.20.0.10/32` and adds `core2–service-host` at cost `30`. This is a modeled design candidate, not part of the measured BFD trial topology.\n\nFRR router IDs are `access1 .11`, `access2 .12`, `agg1 .21`, `agg2 .22`, `core1 .31`, and `core2 .32` in `10.255.0.0/24`; the candidate service-host uses `.40`. Transit links use `/31` point-to-point addressing.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.1.0",
      "title": "Topology models & traffic-path policy",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixedColor"}, "decimals": 3, "noValue": "NO EVIDENCE", "unit": "s"}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 3, "x": 14, "y": 4},
      "id": 7,
      "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "textMode": "value_and_name", "wideLayout": true},
