      "options": {
        "code": {"language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false},
        "content": "### Measurement contract\n\n`carrier-up blackhole → BFD Down → OSPF Neighbor Down → route metric 30 → 140 → ICMP recovery`\n\nLive offsets use the collector's monotonic clock with 100 ms polling and are **observed upper bounds**. The sequence is the collector's staged completion contract; it is not inferred from Prometheus samples. Prometheus scrapes every 1 second for visualization only. Results apply to this local containerlab topology and configuration; they are not a production SLA.",
        "mode": "markdown"
